flowchart TD
    accTitle: Texture creation wrapper responsibilities
    accDescr: Each layer carries a different contract: resource semantics, dispatch, storage metadata, device validation, or native API translation.
    Resource[ImageTexture resource] -->|scene identity and properties| API[RenderingServer API]
    API -->|virtual dispatch| Dispatch[RenderingServerDefault texture wrapper]
    Dispatch -->|required caller thread| Direct[Direct initialization]
    Dispatch -->|otherwise when required| Queue[CommandQueueMT initialization]
    Direct --> Storage[RendererRD TextureStorage]
    Queue --> Storage
    Storage -->|format metadata and texture views| Device[RenderingDevice texture creation]
    Device -->|validated native description| Driver[RenderingDeviceDriver]
    Driver -->|API allocation| Native[Native texture]
